1.0.8

- Home Screen widgets: words due, today's goal and your streak, plus a
  Mochi widget in today's outfit. Tap to jump straight in.
- Lock Screen widgets, in all three shapes.
- Live Activity: see today's goal on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic
  Island while you study (turn it off in Settings > Presentation).
- Share cards for your goal, Mochi, words, badges and streak (a parent
  can switch sharing off in For parents).
